t","text":"They are based on the text styles for Cascading Style Sheets. The font-family is a comma-separated list of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"font names. The font-style can be normal or italic. The font-size can be one of the CSS sizes or a numeric"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"point size. The font-weight can be normal or bold. The default is application-dependent, but is a text font"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vs. a music font."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLFont"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLFont"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlfont"}}}